DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41993::$$$message_0230_0000_0000$$$::"The guide said it should be around here. We arrived more quickly than I expected."::
41994::$$$message_0230_0000_0001$$$::"We're only halfway there, Master.[lr]::
41995::$$$message_0230_0000_0002$$$::I agree it's been a cakewalk, though. At this rate, we'll reach the final boss in no ti[line len=2]"[nolr]::
41996::$$$message_0230_0001_0000$$$::"Well."::
41997::$$$message_0230_0001_0001$$$::"Oof."::
41998::$$$message_0230_0001_0002$$$::"......Mrgh."[nolr]::
41999::$$$message_0230_0001_0003$$$::"Oh, if it isn't Bazett and Avenger."::
42000::$$$message_0230_0001_0004$$$::"L-Lancer![lr]::
42001::$$$message_0230_0001_0005$$$::Caren wasn't out here by herself!?"::
42002::$$$message_0230_0001_0006$$$::"Of course not.[lr]::
42003::$$$message_0230_0001_0007$$$::If my Master's going out, I'm supposed to help her."::
42004::$$$message_0230_0001_0008$$$::"I'm the one who's surprised, though.[lr]::
42005::$$$message_0230_0001_0009$$$::You actually showed up. I thought you were going to ignore this whole commotion."::
42006::$$$message_0230_0001_0010$$$::"D-don't underestimate me. I'm...I'm more than confident enough to keep up with this game!"::
42007::$$$message_0230_0001_0011$$$::"It's a good chance to loosen up.[lr]::
42008::$$$message_0230_0001_0012$$$::This looks like it could be fun, Master."[nolr]::
42009::$$$message_0230_0001_0013$$$::"Yeah, yeah, enough mushy stuff.[lr]::
42010::$$$message_0230_0001_0014$$$::Your Master is that tomalley woman, hound. You're barking up the wrong tree."::
42011::$$$message_0230_0001_0015$$$::"Huh? Oh, right.[lr]::
42012::$$$message_0230_0001_0016$$$::Sorry, I got carried away. Don't worry about it, mad dog."::
42013::$$$message_0230_0001_0017$$$::"Tomalley...?[lr]::
42014::$$$message_0230_0001_0018$$$::Tomalley...tomalley...tomalley...[lr]::
42015::$$$message_0230_0001_0019$$$::Archer, what is 'tomalley'?"::
42016::$$$message_0230_0001_0020$$$::"Um, I think it's crab entrails.[lr]::
42017::$$$message_0230_0001_0021$$$::After all, Caren..."[nolr]::
42018::$$$message_0230_0002_0000$$$::"When your guts come flying out, it kinda looks like a crab.[lr]::
42019::$$$message_0230_0002_0001$$$::If you were to judge it based on the silhouette alone, you'd look like a boss from a shoot 'em up game."::
42020::$$$message_0230_0002_0002$$$::"..."[nolr]::
42021::$$$message_0230_0003_0000$$$::"Enough fraternizing, Lancer."::
42022::$$$message_0230_0004_0000$$$::"Pleasant day to you, Bazett.[lr]::
42023::$$$message_0230_0004_0001$$$::You seem to be looking for the onsen as well."::
42024::$$$message_0230_0004_0002$$$::"Don't play innocent with me. You made those flyers."::
42025::$$$message_0230_0004_0003$$$::"I thought you'd be waiting in ambush at the end, but you've decided to head us off now, instead."::
42026::$$$message_0230_0004_0004$$$::"Hm? [wait canskip=0 time=400]I haven't the faintest idea what you mean, but the Lord must have guided you to me."::
42027::$$$message_0230_0004_0005$$$::"If you're itching for bloodshed, I'll give it to you.[lr]::
42028::$$$message_0230_0004_0006$$$::...Yes, dogs do need to be disciplined."::
42029::$$$message_0230_0004_0007$$$::"Umm, you're pointing that bloodlust the wrong way.[lr]::
42030::$$$message_0230_0004_0008$$$::Point that glare at Bazett, not me."::
42031::$$$message_0230_0004_0009$$$::"...Haah. There's nothing more tragic than a dog biting the hand that feeds it. The shock might tear my heart in two."::
42032::$$$message_0230_0004_0010$$$::"...I'm such a shameful woman. My heart is beating so fast, it's as if I'm a maiden in love."::
42033::$$$message_0230_0004_0011$$$::"I almost can't take it anymore. The thought of a dog being drawn and quartered in front of me is sending my heart aflutter."::
42034::$$$message_0230_0004_0012$$$::"Yup. No escaping from that 'maidenly' necrophilia."::
42035::$$$message_0230_0004_0013$$$::"...Fine.[lr]::
42036::$$$message_0230_0004_0014$$$::Good luck, Bazett. I'll be hanging out in the back, ready to cheer you on in case you want to run."::
42037::$$$message_0230_0004_0015$$$::"Leave it to me. I'll protect you![lr]::
42038::$$$message_0230_0004_0016$$$::It's time to settle this, Caren!"::
42039::$$$message_0230_0004_0017$$$::"You're like a bull before the matador, Bazett.[lr]::
42040::$$$message_0230_0004_0018$$$::Very well. This really isn't my style, but I'll face you myself."::
42041::$$$message_0230_0004_0019$$$::"Huh? You aren't going to give us any orders, Master? I thought your shroud didn't work on women."::
42042::$$$message_0230_0004_0020$$$::"That's just your prejudice, Archer. This is Bazett we're talking about. The Holy Shroud sees not one's physical sex, but the gender of the soul."::
42043::$$$message_0230_0004_0021$$$::"So it might work,[lr]::
42044::$$$message_0230_0004_0022$$$::if you catch my meaning."::
42045::$$$message_0230_0004_0023$$$::"He. Hehe. Hehehehehe![lr]::
42046::$$$message_0230_0004_0024$$$::Don't stop me, Aŋra. [wm canskip=0][hfangry layer=0]It's legal to kill someone in the ring...!"[nolr]¿k�